WEBVTT

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:40.090
"There shall come a controller of a dark
star who shall call forth the light."

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.060
"And the world shall be
flooded with darkness."

00:01:42.130 --> 00:01:43.620
"Dragon's blood shall spread..."

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.660
"...and following the power
between light and darkness..."

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:48.720
"...a single star
shall be awakened."

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.560
"Around the star
shall spin five lights."

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:55.010
"And the power shall be
a darkness beyond twilight."

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.200
"A brilliance beyond the dawn."

00:01:57.710 --> 00:02:00.840
"When the power is loosed,
we shall fall to an arrow..."

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:02.940
"...which will split
the heavens apart."

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.450
As foretold by the
prophecy of destruction...

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:09.320
...the controller of the
"dark star," Darkstar himself...

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:12.250
...has come to this world!

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:14.990
But what we saw
next was Valgaav...

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.590
...seemingly returned
from the dead!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.740
Fire Dragon King...

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:31.340
To preserve the
peace of this world...

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.640
...we faithfully followed you.

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:37.150
But the result...

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:50.630
Only I am left here now.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:55.370
I believe what we did
was the right thing.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.340
I believe, and yet...

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.870
Oh, Fire Dragon King...

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:07.650
What were you trying to tell us
in that prophecy of destruction?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:38.910
Valgaav!

00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.520
What's going on here?

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.930
I thought Mr. Valgaav had
been swallowed by Darkstar.

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:04.730
Lord Valgaav!

00:04:05.540 --> 00:04:07.730
Is it really Valgaav?

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:13.310
That time, in trying to destroy
everything in this world...

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:17.170
...when Valgaav summoned
Darkstar, he was!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:22.020
I thought he'd been
killed by Darkstar.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:27.630
How... How could
he still be alive?

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:31.490
Meaning you want to know
who's really standing there.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:32.330
Well...

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.430
In any case...

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.440
...we have to assume it can
only be Darkstar himself!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:45.880
In that case... We have
only one path to take!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.080
We must kill him!

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:02.860
Nezzard, which gouges!

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.560
Bodigar, which smashes!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.350
DI FLASHER!

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.350
The Supreme Elder!

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:15.090
The Ancient Dragon!

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:24.240
Why is he here? Why?!

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.490
Supreme Elder!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.660
RESURRECTION!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:55.910
Filia...

00:06:56.340 --> 00:07:00.440
Elder, why? Why did you?!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:05.410
He's hurt really bad.
I don't think...

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:16.620
His power's incredible.
Is that really Valgaav?

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.130
Did he die
before or not?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.490
Perhaps we could
call it obsession.

00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:24.570
Could the extreme
hatred he possessed...

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:27.440
...let him survive even after
being devoured by Darkstar?

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.670
Or else, perhaps...

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.740
Darkstar is now a
fusion of God and Monster!

00:07:32.810 --> 00:07:35.180
A creature who is a fusion
of Dragon and Monster...

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:37.710
...must have resonated with him.

00:07:39.850 --> 00:07:42.190
Ancient Dragon!

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:48.690
Even now, you wish for
this world's destruction?

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.730
Supreme Elder!

00:08:11.280 --> 00:08:15.220
Well? How does it
feel to be destroyed...

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:17.280
...by one of those
YOU destroyed?

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:23.990
How does it feel to have your
past mistake endanger the world?

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.060
Well, servant of the Gods?

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:33.400
Ancient Dragon...
I take all responsibility...

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.200
However...

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:38.980
I don't recall ever
making a mistake!

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:44.850
In that case, your very
existence is a mistake.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:46.510
Now begone!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:09.700
Filia!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.400
Filia!

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.060
The little lady...

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:35.600
I am the last of the golden dragons
who served the Fire Dragon King.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.300
I'm now just like you.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:41.470
I'm also no
longer a priestess.

00:09:41.570 --> 00:09:44.700
I think now I deserve
to talk to you.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:50.710
Oh? Then I'll ask this:
Who do YOU hate?

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:52.420
I don't hate anybody!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:12.440
Everything you said
was true. So, how?

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:15.730
How can I atone for
the sin we committed?!

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.330
How can I ask
for forgiveness?!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:23.950
How do I quell the
hatred you feel?! Valgaav!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.780
How many more must be sacrificed
before you're satisfied?!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:27.810
Filia!

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.220
You don't understand at all.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:41.900
What I want isn't more
sacrifices. What I want...

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.960
...is the purification
of the entire world.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.370
Purification?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.210
You want purification?

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:22.990
Exactly. This polluted
world itself is to blame!

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:28.470
I'm going to return everything to its
original form so it can start over.

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:30.470
Its original form?

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:33.000
Let me ask you this:

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:37.130
Why does the war between the Gods
and Monsters eternally repeat itself?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.110
Why does the battle go on?!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:44.340
Sometimes the Gods
beat back the Monsters.

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:47.290
Sometimes the Monsters
defeat the Gods.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:52.290
So why do they battle
for all eternity? WHY?!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:57.390
That's something no one in
any world is allowed to know.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.860
You still haven't
figured it out?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:05.390
It's because we're all caught in a
trap that somebody created for us!

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.200
We are never supposed to have
that kind of thought!

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:16.580
It's a cruel story, isn't it?

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:22.420
Darkstar and Volphied, who are now
part of me, told me all about it.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.920
Everyone is now exhausted.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:29.150
So why don't I just break
this endless cycle of hell?

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.690
Overworlders!
The purification of all worlds...

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:36.630
...is the wish of both
Darkstar AND Volphied!

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.340
What?! Then...

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.530
You're saying our own God
WANTED us to be destroyed?!

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:46.640
Exactly! That's why
Volphied merged with Darkstar...

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.510
...and decided to purify
and recreate your world!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.540
In other words...

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.210
They're rebelling
against their creator!

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:56.020
Purification and recreation?

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:59.490
A God and Monster, joining
to destroy everything?

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:03.500
It can't be!
Then all we've done...

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:06.900
For what reason?
Why must the world be?!

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.460
You mind waiting
a second, pal?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:11.270
There's no way we're
gonna let you do that.

00:13:11.340 --> 00:13:12.000
Miss Lina!

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:15.940
Don't forget there's an acting
representative for humanity here, too!

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.810
Humans? The power between
light and darkness!

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.650
That's right!
The prophecy said...

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:28.050
...the power of humans
was necessary. But why?

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.580
Just 'cuz you guys
have been trapped...

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.220
...for a re-e-eally long time
in some stupid pattern...

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.230
...doesn't mean we have
to die because of it!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:39.130
Staying alive is the most
important thing of all to us!

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:39.860
Lina!

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.570
That's right! Don't forget
we have a say in this, too!

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.760
We're not going to let you
do whatever you want!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.340
Sorry, but we're gonna
fight as hard as we can!

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.970
Humans, who live
short yet full lives...

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.680
The power they gain from
their desire to live...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.580
The existence of humans
is the key to the prophecy!

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.550
Enough of your madness!

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.510
We have to attack
together at full power!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:24.980
You ready, Zel? Gourry?

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:25.940
Ready!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:29.080
Hey! Aren't we
forgetting someone?

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:33.980
Mr. Jillas!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:40.980
No matter who he is, as long as
he possesses Darkstar's power...

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.980
...we have to kill him!

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:43.720
Right!

00:14:56.940 --> 00:15:01.740
Hey, Gourry...
You really think I can win?

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:04.780
Sure. You'll do just fine.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:07.780
Sure.

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:12.020
Mr. Zelgadis,
when this battle's over...

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.460
...will you come back
to Seyruun with me?

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.420
Well, I'll think about it.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:17.160
Okay!

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:25.070
Here he comes! Use the Darkstar
weapons and attack at full power!

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:26.970
Light, come forth!

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.430
Light, come forth!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.030
Huh? What the?!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.120
Go on, Lina! Cast Lord
Ruby-Eye's spell into Galvayra!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:51.790
All right!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:56.200
"Darkness beyond twilight,
crimson beyond blood that flows."

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.700
"Buried in the flow of time..."

00:15:57.770 --> 00:16:01.800
"In thy great name,
I pledge myself to darkness."

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:05.640
"Let all the fools who
stand before us be destroyed..."

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.480
"...by the power
you and I possess!"

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.650
DRAGON SLAVE!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.750
Even that didn't affect him?!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.440
What the?
A spell to summon an ark?!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.450
Damn his strength!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:49.150
Is that really only
a PART of Darkstar?!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:54.620
Miss Lina! At this rate,
we're going to get killed!

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:00.930
Is the Giga Slave
our only chance now?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:04.930
Incoming!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:10.840
What the?!

00:17:21.590 --> 00:17:25.350
Don't worry.
Death does not await you.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.750
After the purification,
you shall be reborn.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:29.160
What do you mean?

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.430
The war between the
Gods and Monsters...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:36.300
...originally grew out
of a supreme desire.

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.770
However, the servants
of the Gods...

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.570
...and the agents of the Monsters
forgot what that desire was.

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.350
And to defeat each other, they now
fight only for the sake of fighting.

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:50.650
How long must we be trapped
in this useless war?!

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:56.580
I possess both the
desire and the power...

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:59.780
...of the God Volphied and
the Dark Lord Darkstar!

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:02.690
I will break this cycle,
destroy everything, and start over!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.500
Recreate the world into the
peaceful form it SHOULD be!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:10.500
A psychic attack! He's draining
us from the Astral Plane!

00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:11.960
Xellos!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:18.370
The Gods and Monsters must
not be allowed to exist.

00:18:22.320 --> 00:18:26.080
You, whose lives
are so brief! Humans!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:29.850
Why do you devote yourselves
to living when you die so soon?

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.150
Don't you want peace?!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:37.060
Don't you think it would be
better to change this world...

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.100
...and end this eternal
deadlock at last?

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:43.900
Make it so no one would hurt
anyone or be hurt by anyone?

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.110
Damn it, at this rate he'll
drain us completely!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:52.540
Amelia! Sing!
Sing anything about life!

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:53.310
R- Right!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:57.050
Life is wonderful!
Life is marvelous!

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.550
Life is hope!
Living is great!

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:04.110
Happy! Happy! Live happily!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:05.650
Valgaav...

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:09.460
Sorry, but humanity's
still worth saving.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.320
Miss Lina!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:17.800
Compared to you, maybe we do
live lives that are too short.

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:22.310
We're foolish, make mistakes,
and get hurt so easily, but...

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:25.810
But with each mistake,
we improve ourselves!

00:19:25.880 --> 00:19:29.650
With each wound, we don't
want to be hurt again!

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:34.080
We keep moving on!
We cherish the past, the present...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:37.780
...AND the future, so we
want to keep moving forward!

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.790
There's no way we'll
let you ruin that!

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:45.760
We're never going to stop,
because we LIVE!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:49.400
Um, excuse me? If you start
everything over again...

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:52.560
...then everything we've done
won't have happened, right?

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.310
Well, screw that!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.280
He's right. I don't want
to lose the person I am.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:58.310
Exactly!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:04.370
Valgaav... If you really
want to destroy the world...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.650
To purify it, then why?

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:11.350
Why do I see such
sadness in your eyes?!

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.990
I know why! Lord Valgaav,
you saved me once!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.460
You're a good man!
Please, come back to us!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.060
Lord Valgaav!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:25.990
Once begun,
it cannot be stopped.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:29.340
Very well! Try if you like!

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:32.970
You, who fight
to keep on living!

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.480
How can we?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.030
How are we supposed
to kill him?!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:52.620
Where's Darkstar...
Where's Valgaav going now?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.800
In any case...

00:20:55.570 --> 00:21:00.030
If we don't... If we don't
defeat him, the world is doomed!

00:22:21.650 --> 00:22:23.750
Laugh or cry,
it's the final episode!

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.760
But there's no way I won't
be laughing at the end!

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:30.020
Next time: " Try Again!
When All Returns to White!"

00:22:30.100 --> 00:22:33.190
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
